Package: libxkbcommon-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBXKBCOMMON_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libxkbcommon0 (= @DEB_LIBXKBCOMMON_V@)
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://xkbcommon.org
Description: Development files for libxkbcommon
 libxkbcommon is a keymap compiler and support library which processes a
 reduced subset of keymaps as defined by the XKB specification. This package
 contains the headers, pkg-config file and development symlink.
